    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Pay attention to the reporting verb tense: tense shifts only occur if the reporting verb is in the past tense.",
        "Universal truths, facts, and habitual actions do not change their tense even when the reporting verb is in the past tense.",
        "Ensure proper transformation of time and place words (e.g., 'now' to 'then', 'here' to 'there', 'today' to 'that day')."
